  "body": "## Summary\n- keep `FlipBotPlaywrightApplication` as the single entry point\n- when `FLIPBOT_TEST_AUTOMATION=true` has a valid loopback/`.test` target, make the existing marketplace URL/trust layer use that exact origin for HOME/CATALOG/INBOX, listing URLs and conversation URLs\n- automatically attach the guarded fingerprint profile/network boundary to normal worker BrowserContexts in valid controlled mode\n- make PRICE_PROBE use the same controlled test origin, so simple mode needs one target URL rather than a second probe URL\n- keep invalid or production controlled targets fail-closed: controlled extras are skipped while normal Vinted runtime remains available\n- tighten test URL/proxy validation against credential-bearing URLs\n\n## Safety boundaries\n- controlled runtime still requires `FingerprintLabPolicy`: loopback, `*.localhost`, `test`, or `*.test`\n- exact scheme/host/port matching is required once a controlled origin is selected\n- Vinted and arbitrary production hosts cannot become controlled targets\n- PRICE_PROBE still rejects `vinted.pl` and subdomains outside controlled mode\n\n## Tests\n- add exact controlled-origin matching regression coverage\n- add credential-bearing lab/proxy URL rejection coverage",
